Hanumān scours Vindhya caves with Aṅgada Tāra Jāmbavān and others --- Thirsty monkeys sight creeper-hid cave disgorging waterbirds --- Hanumān infers well or lake from moist trees --- Monkeys enter sunless dread cave clinging one yōjana --- Wanderers despair then glimpse light in darkness --- Monkeys behold golden trees lotus ponds golden fish --- Monkeys behold aerial cars gem beds vessels garments food --- Monkeys confront bark-clad blazing fasting woman questioning her
